UnitV2Gauge::PendingFees
├── when the gauge is not a pool
│   └── it should return zero amounts
├── when the emission cap is zero
│   └── it should return zero amounts
├── when the gauge is not activated
│   └── it should return zero amounts
├── when the pool has no pending fees
│   └── it should return zero amounts
└── when the pool has pending fees
    └── it should return the pool pending fees
